abstract: "Official Windows 10/11 (x64) installer release and user guide repository for Pixel Banban (像素斑斑), a cozy transparent pixel-art calico cat desktop pet (shimeji / screenmate) that walks along the monitor bottom, climbs foreground app windows, interacts with 7 physics/gesture toys, and unlocks local episodic stories."
